    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to call but it doesn't change anything. it just doesn't. nothing actually changes. it's just the same thing every single morning. waking up and realizing i have to deal with all of it again. i'm just so tired of fighting it. sometimes i look at him and i just think... what if i wasn't even here? what if i just could finally just sleep and never have to wake up to this again?",
